<title>POLAND: GPRD SURGES 49 PCT ON BOURSE DEBUT.</title>
<headline>GPRD SURGES 49 PCT ON BOURSE DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish road builder Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA (GPRD) started trade on the Warsaw bourse's main market at 16.7 zlotys, 49.1 percent higher than its issue price.</p>
<p>The GPRD's late November and early December issue of 2,248,700 shares, priced at 11.2 zlotys per share, was heavily oversubscribed.  -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
